.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1163716-half-damned-errata-thread\"> Half-Damned errata thread - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1163716-half-damned-errata-thread\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1163716-half-damned-errata-thread </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Please include your errata below. This thread is limited to reporting numerical errors, typos, visual glitches, and the like. If you have questions or would otherwise like to discuss the product, please take it to another thread. Please include a page reference for all reported issues. Thank you. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-29T16:59:09-08:00","id":1163762,"title":"","content":"Just finished my first read through, primarily of the ghoul and dhampir sections.<br /> <br /> I find myself considering rebooting an old demon-blooded ghoul concept of mine into a demon-blooded dhampir, instead. I was pleasantly surprised to see all of the new abilities they have access to, instead of just recycled material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-30T04:23:36-08:00","id":1163860,"title":"","content":"Just saw this was out. If someone can send some info on what would be needed for a character sheet(compared the regular requiem sheet) and the logo graphic(if able) I'd be happy to work on a sheet for this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-30T06:28:51-08:00","id":1163891,"title":"","content":"Have it. Skimmed it. I'm a little disappointed that there is no mechanic for ghouls self-generating Vitae ala VtM Revenants. That would have fit well into the &quot;specials&quot; section for them. <br /> <br /> Such deviations will remain homebrew, then. Need to read dhampirs more closely to determine if they are more or less intended to fulfill that kind of slot, or if they are &quot;less-suck revenants&quot;. The actual revenant section is a breath of fresh air and a good take that puts them someplace better than &quot;quick slide to draugr&quot; and &quot;the Prince's next distraction for the city: hunting you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Both of which could still apply, of course.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-30T11:03:00-08:00","id":1163985,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure it's intentional that Ghouls can't self-process Vitae.<br /> Vitae is inherently a double-edged sword which bringing definite hardships along with it, and Ghouls' hardship is that they need an outside source.<br /> Vamps Great Banes are Fire and Sunlight, while a Ghoul's great bane is the inability to create the stolen life-nectar of the dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","user":"Rathamus","date":". 11-30-2017, 02:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11661-rathamus","name":"Rathamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11661_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-30T14:44:18-08:00","id":1164067,"title":"","content":"And with this shiny new book comes a shiny new update to the Requiem 2e genre directory:<br /> <a href=\"http://jessilaurn.com/Genre_Directories/VtR2_Guide_TT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://jessilaurn.com/Genre_Director...2_Guide_TT.pdf</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1731-jessilaurn","name":"Jessilaurn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1731_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-02T15:00:54-08:00","id":1164650,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3570_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3570\" data-vbnamecard=\"3570\">lnodiv</a> was kind enough to send me some info, so I have some sheets for Half-Damned ready! I made sheets Dhampir and Revenants!<br /> <br /> Hope you like how they turned out!<br /> <br /> Dhampir:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshell